# Real deployment config never belongs in the toolkit repo — only the examples do.
#
# ANCHORED WITH A LEADING SLASH, deliberately. A bare `tenants.yaml` matches at
# every depth, which silently excluded test/fixtures/tenants.yaml — the tests
# passed locally against a file that had never been committed, and CI failed on
# a fresh clone. These three patterns must only ever match the repo root.
/deployment.yaml
/tenants.yaml
/ops.yaml
